title: A 12000 line file changed at its first and last line: the diff inside its card on, around 0, unfold, split, off; the last rows keep the real line numbers (12002 is '// bottom') and nothing is left of the diff after off
folders: odd-files
limit: 80
expect-file: odd-files/big.rs :: ^// top\npub fn f0\(\) -> usize \{ 0 \}\n[\s\S]*pub fn f11999\(\) -> usize \{ 11999 \}\n// bottom\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 4000
left changes
edit big.rs 1 1
type // top
key enter
key save
wait 800
key escape
wait 2500
touch big.rs // bottom
wait 2500
tool edit
goto big.rs
wait 1200
find // bottom
wait 1500
mark 0-plain-bottom
wait 500
diff on
wait 2500
goto big.rs
wait 1500
mark 1-on
wait 500
diff around 0
wait 2000
goto big.rs
wait 1200
mark 2-around-0
wait 500
diff unfold
wait 2500
find next
wait 1500
mark 3-unfold-bottom
wait 500
diff split
wait 2500
find next
wait 1500
mark 4-split-unfold-bottom
wait 500
diff off
wait 2500
find next
wait 1500
mark 5-off-bottom
wait 500
find close
quit
